      "Severe hepatic impairment",
      "Concomitant strong CYP3A4 substrates (cisapride, pimozide, ergot, some statins — lovastatin/simvastatin, triazolam, high-dose quetiapine)",
      "Long QT/PR syndrome (caution)"
